{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週のNOGIBINGO!観てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい映れた～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/14/3193297/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アシスタントは残念だったけど\nよくよく考えたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天だけじゃなくて\n生ドルだって沈金だって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まともにMCやアシスタントMCの役割を\n果たせたこと無かった！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるべくして\nならなかったのですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/14/3193297/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ おめでとうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!7\n#2からもお楽しみに～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/14/3193297/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/14/3193297/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は『墓場、女子高生』\n観てきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/14/3193297/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ中国シリーズのリハと\n舞台稽古がかぶってて\n毎日めちゃめちゃ大変そうだったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな完璧で余裕もって演じてて\n舞台を楽しんでる感じがすごい良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/14/3193297/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"協調性があって空気が読める純奈があの役だったり\n上品で常に女性らしい振る舞いのちまがあの役だったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの\nいつもと全然違う姿を演じてるのも観れたし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に\nそれぞれの本人の良さも出てると思った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくは言えませんが\n非日常なようでいて\nとても考えさせられるお話でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、初日ですね\nみんな頑張ってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/14/3193297/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に行く方も楽しんできてね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、\n中田は今日は沈金ですよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/14/3193297/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観覧もお待ちしてますね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}